title: "Disuza Quantitative Public Technical Reference"
abstract: >-
  Disuza Quantitative is a private, pre-deployment quantitative R&D initiative
  building and validating rule-based systematic trading infrastructure. This
  versioned public reference distinguishes current, in-progress, and target
  state. It does not represent a live trading system, investment activity,
  investment performance, legal registration, or regulatory authorization.
